  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eco tourism,Amber trail</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ekoturism,B&#xE4;rnstensleden</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B&#xE4;rnstensleden planeras som en 80 km l&#xE5;ng vandringsled utmed den lettiska kusten, mellan Liepaja-Pavilosta-Jurkalne. Sidas insats innefattar utbildning i att bygga och driva B&#xE4;rnstensleden och skapa en f&#xF6;rst&#xE5;else f&#xF6;r villkoren f&#xF6;r utveckling av ekoturism i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Amber Trail Programme is establishing a 80 km long hiking trail between Liepaja-Pavilosta-Jurkalene. The project to be carried out by Sida will be focusing on training in, sustainable tourism for local policy makers, building of pilot structures for constructors, nature conservation, tourism development etc.</narrative>
  </description>
